Package: torontoelections
Title: Download, Verify and Load the Toronto Election Results Dataset
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Olson", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6593-2779"))
Description: Downloads a published version of Toronto Election Results, the
    candidates and results of the municipal, school board trustee, federal and
    provincial elections held within the City of Toronto since 1993, with each
    person's runs for office joined. Checks every file against its published
    SHA-256 checksum, keeps a local cache, and returns the tables with typed
    columns and the codebook's labels.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
